ign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"5682\" data-file-height=\"3899\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jean_Bartik\" title=\"Jean Bartik\">Betty Jennings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Frances_Spence\" title=\"Frances Spence\">Fran Bilas</a>, part of the first <a href=\"/wiki/ENIAC\" title=\"ENIAC\">ENIAC</a> programming team</div></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\">Occupation</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Names</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Computer Programmer</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\">Occupation type</div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">Profession</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\">Activity sectors</div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Information_technology\" title=\"Information technology\">Information technology</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Software_industry\" title=\"Software industry\">Software industry</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\">Description</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Competencies</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Writing and debugging computer code</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\">Education required</div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Varies from apprenticeship to bachelor's degree, or self-taught</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>A <b>programmer</b>, <b>computer programmer</b> or <b>coder</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Author\" title=\"Author\">author</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Computer\" title=\"Computer\">computer</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Source_code\" title=\"Source code\">source code</a>, or someone with skill in <a href=\"/wiki/Computer_programming\" title=\"Computer programming\">computer programming</a>. The professional titles <a href=\"/wiki/Software_developer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Software developer\">software developer</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Software_engineer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Software engineer\">software engineer</a> may be used for <a href=\"/wiki/Job_(role)\" title=\"Job (role)\">jobs</a> that require a programmer.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐6rcml\nCached time: 20260918180751\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.261 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.404 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 766/1000000\nRevision size: 1072/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 40731/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14914/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/100\nExpensive parser function count: 7/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9396/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.146/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 2379373/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 1/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  360.027      1 -total\n 31.06%  111.832      1 Template:Multiple_issues\n 28.95%  104.240      1 Template:Short_description\n 18.80%   67.679      3 Template:Ambox\n 18.32%   65.939      1 Template:Infobox_occupation\n 17.53%   63.130      2 Template:Pagetype\n 16.59%   59.742      1 Template:Original_research\n 16.39%   58.994      1 Template:Infobox\n 12.41%   44.693      1 Template:About\n  6.93%   24.956      5 Template:Main_other\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID dcb70351-b38b-11f1-a2a2-cb5300f4ca1e -->\n</div>",
